    "title": "Embedded Payments Emerge as a FinTech M&A Target",
    "summary": "FinTech buyers looking for growth in a tough funding and software market are finding something valuable inside real estate closings, municipal bills, healthcare practices and commercial banking. The payment is already attached to the work. A series of summer transactions is putting money behind that model. Fifth Third said Aug. 19 that it led a […]\nThe post Embedded Payments Emerge as a FinTech M&A Target appeared first on PYMNTS.com.",
